Memory Formula (Use for Life)

Whenever you see:
Find Largest
Find Smallest
Highest
Lowest
Maximum
Minimum
Think instantly:
Initialize
        ↓
Traverse
        ↓
Compare
        ↓
Update
        ↓
Return

I call this the ITCUR Formula:

I → Initialize
T → Traverse
C → Compare
U → Update
R → Return

This same thinking works for maximum, minimum, second largest, second smallest, stock profit, Kadane's algorithm, and many other array problems.
